<title>AUSTRALIA: NatMut cuts variable home loan to 6.49 pct.</title>
<headline>NatMut cuts variable home loan to 6.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group National Mutual Holdings Ltd on Wednesday announced it would cut its varibale home loan rate to 6.49 percent from 6.99 percent.  </p>
<p>The rate cut is effective from August 31 for new and existing borrowers, National Mutual said.</p>
<p>The announcement followed the Reserve Bank of Australia's move on Wednesday to cut the official cash rate to five percent from 5.5 percent -- the fifth official easing in a year.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 613-9286-1421</p>
</text>
